    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90c2271214178f6f0efe524c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯……精油的种类虽丰富，但最重要的植物油却很少。\n看来比起美容效果，他们更重视浓郁的香气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7091a185172863ff2022257f033ab0ec665d5bb7573a67a1f0ea6ed1f1552de7",
