    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77add80bf15159e2f9ebc09c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从早上起床的瞬间，痛苦就已经开始了。\n你有过被自己的头发弄到差点窒息而吓醒的经验吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1809d4f14944f59a355c70e57c0f835fe714f62d2cb51e956488a6680ebb922",
